WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.235 --> 00:00:03.070
[sirens wailing
in the distance]

00:00:03.103 --> 00:00:06.073
[ominous music]

00:00:06.106 --> 00:00:08.742
♪

00:00:08.775 --> 00:00:10.344
[gun cocks]
- WHAT? WHAT? WHAT?

00:00:10.377 --> 00:00:11.845
WHAT? WHAT? WHAT?
CHECK YO'SELF,

00:00:11.879 --> 00:00:14.314
BEFORE I BODY PIERCE
YOUR DAMN SKULL.

00:00:14.348 --> 00:00:15.682
- THINK YOU CAN PULL THAT
TRIGGER 'FORE I BLOW

00:00:15.716 --> 00:00:17.451
YOUR PERSONALITY OUT THE BACK
OF YO' HEAD?

00:00:17.484 --> 00:00:19.319
THEN GO RIGHT AHEAD AND TEST
THE HYPOTHESIS

00:00:19.353 --> 00:00:20.587
AND SEE WHAT HAPPENS.

00:00:20.621 --> 00:00:21.722
- A'IGHT, I'MA GIVE YOU

00:00:21.755 --> 00:00:23.757
A STRAIGHT-UP
VAMPIRE "C"-SECTION,

00:00:23.790 --> 00:00:24.758
LIKE WE WAS...

00:00:24.791 --> 00:00:28.061
both: EDWARD AND BELLA.

00:00:28.095 --> 00:00:29.696
- HOLD UP.

00:00:29.730 --> 00:00:31.064
YOU LIKE <i>TWILIGHT?</i>

00:00:31.098 --> 00:00:33.967
- YEAH, I LIKE <i>TWILIGHT,</i>
[bleep].

00:00:34.001 --> 00:00:35.169
YOU LIKE <i>TWILIGHT?</i>

00:00:35.202 --> 00:00:38.772
- [bleep], <i>TWILIGHT'S</i>
MY JAM.

00:00:38.805 --> 00:00:41.275
- YOU A EDWARD [bleep]
OR A JACOB [bleep]?

00:00:41.308 --> 00:00:43.010
- ANSWER THAT [bleep]
TOGETHER.

00:00:43.043 --> 00:00:44.845
THREE, TWO, ONE.

00:00:44.878 --> 00:00:45.913
both: EDWARD.

00:00:45.946 --> 00:00:47.981
- SHI...
- SHI...

00:00:48.015 --> 00:00:49.049
- ARE YOU [bleep]ING
WITH ME?

00:00:49.082 --> 00:00:50.217
- ARE YOU [bleep]ING
WITH ME?

00:00:50.250 --> 00:00:51.952
- YOU EITHER PLAYING
SOME [bleep]ED-UP GAME,

00:00:51.985 --> 00:00:53.987
OR YOU ARE STRAIGHT-UP
INSIDE MY HEAD.

00:00:54.021 --> 00:00:55.689
- YO, AND WHEN YOU SAID
YOU WAS GONNA BLOW

00:00:55.722 --> 00:00:57.824
MY PERSONALITY
OUT THE BACK OF MY HEAD,

00:00:57.858 --> 00:00:59.593
I'M LIKE,

00:00:59.626 --> 00:01:01.461
"THAT SOUNDS LIKE SOME [bleep]
I WOULD SAY."

00:01:01.495 --> 00:01:03.063
- PSH.
- AND NOW THIS <i>TWILIGHT</i> [bleep]?

00:01:03.063 --> 00:01:04.398
- IT'S WAVELENGTH, [bleep].

00:01:04.431 --> 00:01:06.967
- SO I GUESS WE FRIENDS THEN.
- OH, WE BEST FRIENDS NOW.

00:01:07.067 --> 00:01:08.669
WE THE BEST OF FRIENDS!

00:01:08.702 --> 00:01:13.440
- BFFs?
- WE ARE BFFs, M.F.

00:01:13.473 --> 00:01:16.443
[happy music]

00:01:16.476 --> 00:01:24.484
♪

00:01:51.612 --> 00:01:53.480
- [laughing]
- NO, YOU DIDN'T!

00:01:53.514 --> 00:01:54.815
NO, YOU DIDN'T.
- YES, I DID!

00:01:54.848 --> 00:01:56.350
- [laughing]
THAT IS A CRA--

00:01:56.383 --> 00:01:57.618
THAT'S A CRAZY STORY, MAN.

00:01:57.651 --> 00:02:00.921
[both laughing]

00:02:00.954 --> 00:02:02.556
